The '''Desert Settlement''' is a sub-location of the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}.

{{ZoneText|Talk to the settlement inhabitants.}}

== Features ==
The '''Desert Settlement''' is located at the spawn of the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}} and has {{Green|4}} houses, {{Green|3}} of which are inhabited, each by {{NPCSprite|Beth}}, {{NPCSprite|Mason}} and the {{NPCSprite|Friendly Hiker}}.

