== Trivia ==
* While {{NPCSprite|Technoblade}} was [[Mayor]] after {{NPCSprite|Dante}}'s defeat, a {{NPCSprite|Technoshop}} appeared near the '''Desert Settlement''' for a limited time. It sold the same items as that in the [[Hub]]'s {{zone|Community Center}}.
* The empty house was most likely inhabited by the {{NPCSprite|Hungry Hiker}} before he got lost in the {{Zone|Mushroom Gorge}}.

